flowchart TD
    Query[User query and session_id] --> Entry[Load SDK session and enter Runner]
    Entry --> Reason[LLM reasoning and tool selection]
    Reason --> Select{Tool needed?}
    Select -->|No| Answer[Final model answer]
    Select -->|Yes| Call[MCP tools/call with JSON Schema arguments]
    Call --> Server[Selected filesystem, Tavily, or Open-Meteo server]
    Server --> Result{Valid tool result?}
    Result -->|Yes| Append[Append real result to agent context]
    Result -->|Execution or protocol failure| Error[Sanitized tool failure or handled HTTP error]
    Append --> Synthesis[LLM synthesis using results]
    Error -->|Recoverable tool failure| Synthesis
    Error -->|Unhandled provider or protocol error| Safe[Safe HTTP error / stream error event]
    Synthesis --> More{Another tool needed?}
    More -->|Yes: repeat reasoning| Reason
    More -->|No| Answer
    Answer --> Store[SDK saves conversation items]
    Store --> Response[Return response to caller]
    Reason -.->|Transient model failure: at most two retries| Reason
